  "description": "TUNROM01 crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C65 H55 Dy5 N12 O22,C1 H4 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.722-4.486 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.83-140.42°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C65H55Dy5N12O22·CH4O.",
